# A recipe's steps, checked (tools/make_manual.py --renders; nothing to see or hear: the expects are the point): from P11, headphones, Pitch lock off, Scene time 0.
notips
phones 1
set 74 0
set 71 0
press SEL
tapkey w15
release SEL
tapkey w2
tap PLAY
wait 3000
expect view 0
wait 1500
press FX
wait 400
expect view 13
turn K4 30 80
wait 300
wait 1500
release FX
wait 600
expect view 0
wait 4000
